                    <div class="px-3 py-1 rounded-2xl text-xs font-medium bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500/10 to-purple-500/10 text-indigo-400 border border-indigo-500/20 flex items-center gap-x-1.5">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-globe fa-sm"></i>
                        <span>END-TO-END SOVEREIGN SOFTWARE COMPANY</span>
